  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_uv",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1068
        },
        "text": "Tiled UV; a second UV set is offset so the two flow layers never line up."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_flow",
        "position": {
          "x": 1294,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "Two **Flow Map Sample** kits advect the crust map along the same flow field: layer B is slightly slower, pushed further and offset in UV. Their heat values are mixed 65 / 35 so the crust seems to slide over a deeper layer."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_heat",
        "position": {
          "x": 2346,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "`heat = saturate(mix(A.r, B.r, 0.35) + bias)`. *Crust* is the opposite; the green channel adds fine rock detail to the albedo."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_glow",
        "position": {
          "x": 2346,
          "y": 881
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "The **Color Ramp** maps heat to cool → mid → hot HDR colours. A mask `smoothstep(0.05, 0.5, heat)` stops the crust from emitting; a pulse `1 + pulse × ½ sin(2t + 6·heat)` makes the cracks breathe out of phase."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_surf",
        "position": {
          "x": 4928,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "**Height To Normal** (fast kernel) of the crust (1 − heat) gives raised plates between the cracks. Smoothness blends from *Crust Smoothness* to 0.8 with heat — molten rock is glossy."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 5674,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Dark crust albedo, bump normal, heat-driven smoothness and HDR emission."
      }
    ],
